### 1. 查询所有学生（GET）
GET http://localhost:8080/students

### 2. 按学号查询单个学生（GET）
GET http://localhost:8080/students/001

### 3. 添加学生（POST）
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "010",
  "name": "王小二",
  "age": 20
}

### 4. 修改学生（PUT）
PUT http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "010",
  "name": "王大二",
  "age": 21
}

### 5. 删除学生（DELETE）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/students/010